    uid=g200:199_96 StaticText "Target architecture. Labels distinguish the tiny built fixture from future product behavior. Read the connections below the map in either direction."
    uid=g200:199_97 StaticText "Authority stays at the center. Execution stays outside."
    uid=g200:199_98 image "Agora target system connections Browser and client core to Center service: HTTPS commands and resumable events. Native Swift client to Center service: Same public protocol. Center service to PostgreSQL 18: Transactional durable state. Center service to Artifact store: Verified artifact metadata and bytes. Local worker to Center service: Outbound claims and evidence. Cloud execution to Center service: Same worker protocol in S2. Local worker to GitHub: Approved draft; human merges. Center and project-main agents to Center service: Authorized context, never raw SQL. Availability and full connection labels follow in text." description="Browser and client core to Center service: HTTPS commands and resumable events. Native Swift client to Center service: Same public protocol. Center service to PostgreSQL 18: Transactional durable state. Center service to Artifact store: Verified artifact metadata and bytes. Local worker to Center service: Outbound claims and evidence. Cloud execution to Center service: Same worker protocol in S2. Local worker to GitHub: Approved draft; human merges. Center and project-main agents to Center service: Authorized context, never raw SQL. Availability and full connection labels follow in text."
    uid=g200:199_99 StaticText "S1 PLANNED UI; CORE IN PROGRESS"
